# INFAIX Study — WRANGLER/OpenNext local dev secrets (Cloudflare convention).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `next dev` / `wrangler dev`. THIS FILE'S VALUES
# ARE DEV-ONLY AND MUST NOT BE USED IN PRODUCTION. Production uses `npx
# wrangler secret put JWT_SECRET` instead.
NEXTJS_ENV=development
JWT_SECRET=<a-local-only-random-string>